OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval day held to highlight
OL,4,Atown's history
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrimsby is heading back to the Middle
OL,7,FAges with a day of events highlighting
OL,8,Fthe town's medieval history.
OL,10,FVisitors to the free event - called
OL,11,FMedieval Grimsby - will be able to see
OL,12,Fhistorical artefacts from the era as
OL,13,Fwell trying traditional crafts and
OL,14,Fwatching a demonstration of coin
OL,15,Fmaking.
OL,17,FThere will be a chance to make masks
OL,18,Fand also a workshop inspired by the
OL,19,Fstained glass in Grimsby Minster.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
